1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:00,940
Picture this.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,960
You are floating in the open Pacific,

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:06,800
50 kilometers off the coast of California.

4
00:00:08,039 --> 00:00:11,260
Below you is 3,000 meters of black water.

5
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:17,200
The sun is warm on the back of your neck,
the swell is calm, and there isn't a boat

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:17,920
on the horizon.
